msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: en\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "鼠标在图像区时，滚轮可上下移动画布，Shift 加滚轮可横向移动。开启工具栏放大镜后，Ctrl 加滚轮会改变 **Display scale** 并刷新整页。要精确检查 1:1 局部，请按[使用技巧](large-images.md)设置显示与放大比例。"
msgstr "With the pointer over the image area, use the wheel to pan vertically and Shift with the wheel to pan horizontally. With the toolbar magnifier enabled, Ctrl with the wheel changes **Display scale** and refreshes the page. For native-resolution crops, set the display and zoom scales as shown in [Practical tips](large-images.md)."

msgid "工具栏、菜单与快捷键"
msgstr "Toolbar, menus and shortcuts"

msgid "主窗口上方是 File、Edit、Help 三个菜单，下一行是工具栏。下图保留了完整窗口，可按从左到右的顺序对照按钮。"
msgstr "The main window has three menus, File, Edit and Help, with the toolbar immediately below. Read the controls in the screenshot from left to right."

msgid "![主窗口全貌：顶部菜单与工具栏、中央双视频视图、右侧设置及底部状态栏](../media/input-window.png)"
msgstr "![Full window with menus and toolbar above two clips, settings on the right and status below](../media/input-window.png)"

msgid "工具栏从左到右怎么用"
msgstr "Read the toolbar from left to right"

msgid "位置或图标"
msgstr "Position or icon"

msgid "操作"
msgstr "Action"

msgid "文件夹 · 输入模式下拉框"
msgstr "Folder · input mode"

msgid "先选输入模式，再点左侧文件夹。视频输入还需勾选 **Video mode**。四种输入方式的素材要求见[浏览指南](usage.md)。"
msgstr "Choose the input mode, then click the folder to its left. Enable **Video mode** for videos. See the [browsing guide](usage.md) for the four input types."

msgid "软盘"
msgstr "Disk"

msgid "按 **Save Settings** 导出。首次使用先指定输出目录。右侧 **Configuration → Save** 用于保存设置。"
msgstr "Export using **Save Settings**. Choose an output directory first. **Configuration → Save** in the sidebar stores a settings snapshot."

msgid "左箭头 · 播放 · 右箭头"
msgstr "Previous · Play · Next"

msgid "单击箭头翻一页。播放沿最近一次翻页方向继续；想倒放时先点左箭头再点播放。再次点播放或按 Esc 可暂停。"
msgstr "Click an arrow to turn one page. Play follows the most recent paging direction. For reverse playback, click Previous and then Play. Click Play again or press Esc to pause."

msgid "环形箭头 ⟳"
msgstr "Circular arrow ⟳"

msgid "刷新。一次应用积累的布局、显示、算法和缓存修改。"
msgstr "Refresh to apply pending layout, display, algorithm and cache edits together."

msgid "数字框 · 滑块 · 末尾数字"
msgstr "Number field · slider · end label"

msgid "输入页码后按 Enter 精确跳页，或拖动滑块浏览。页码从 1 起，最右数字是总页数。一页可以包含多个来源和多个帧。"
msgstr "Enter a page number and press Enter to jump, or drag the slider to browse. Pages start at 1; the label on the right is the page count. A page can contain several sources and frames."

msgid "放大镜"
msgstr "Magnifier"

msgid "切换画框工具，左键拖出矩形。要看放大内容，还需开启 **Layout & Display → Magnifier** 并刷新。"
msgstr "Toggle box drawing, then left-drag a rectangle. Enable **Layout & Display → Magnifier** and refresh to display the detail."

msgid "弯箭头 ↷ · 镜像 ⏃"
msgstr "Curved arrow ↷ · mirror ⏃"

msgid "先启用工具，再单击目标图。每次点击顺时针旋转 90° 或左右翻转。放大、旋转、镜像三个工具互斥；用完再点已启用的按钮退出。"
msgstr "Activate a tool, then click the target image. Each click rotates it 90° clockwise or mirrors it horizontally. Magnify, rotate and mirror are mutually exclusive. Click the active tool again to turn it off."

msgid "**旋转和镜像会写文件。** 图像模式会在被点中图像的文件路径写回，编码取自当前保存格式；处理珍贵原图前请先复制。视频模式操作的是已拆出的缓存帧，缓存重新生成后修改可能消失。"
msgstr "**Rotate and mirror write to disk.** In image mode they write to the clicked file’s path using the current save format. Make copies of valuable originals first. In video mode the target is an extracted frame; regenerating the cache can replace it."

msgid "File：打开输入和复用来源清单"
msgstr "File: open inputs and reuse source lists"

msgid "菜单项"
msgstr "Menu item"

msgid "默认按键与用途"
msgstr "Default key and action"

msgid "Open → Sequential / Parallel auto"
msgstr "Open → Sequential / Parallel auto"

msgid "**Ctrl+E** 打开单个来源；**Ctrl+A** 打开并自动发现并行来源。"
msgstr "**Ctrl+E** opens one source; **Ctrl+A** opens a folder and discovers parallel sources."

msgid "Open → Parallel manual / Image File List"
msgstr "Open → Parallel manual / Image File List"

msgid "**Ctrl+M** 手动选择来源；**Ctrl+F** 打开图像或视频文件清单。"
msgstr "**Ctrl+M** selects sources manually; **Ctrl+F** opens an image or video file list."

msgid "Select output path"
msgstr "Select output path"

msgid "**Ctrl+O** 选择输出目录。"
msgstr "**Ctrl+O** chooses the output directory."

msgid "Save flist / Input flist – Parallel manual"
msgstr "Save flist / Input flist – Parallel manual"

msgid "手动选好一组图像目录后，**Ctrl+P** 将目录列表写到输出目录的 `input_flist_parallel_manual.txt`；**Ctrl+I** 读回这份目录列表。要逐项打开图片或视频文件，请用 Ctrl+F。"
msgstr "After selecting image directories manually, **Ctrl+P** writes the directory list to `input_flist_parallel_manual.txt` in the output directory. **Ctrl+I** reloads that list. Use Ctrl+F for lists of individual image or video files."

msgid "Edit 与 Help：默认快捷键"
msgstr "Edit and Help: default shortcuts"

msgid "命令"
msgstr "Command"

msgid "Next / Last"
msgstr "Next / Last"

msgid "**Ctrl+N / Ctrl+L** 下一页 / 上一页。"
msgstr "**Ctrl+N / Ctrl+L** move to the next / previous page."

msgid "Save / Refresh / Hidden"
msgstr "Save / Refresh / Hidden"

msgid "**Ctrl+S** 导出，**Ctrl+R** 应用修改，**Ctrl+H** 收起或恢复顶部工具栏和右侧设置区。"
msgstr "**Ctrl+S** exports, **Ctrl+R** applies edits and **Ctrl+H** hides or restores the toolbar and sidebar."

msgid "Pause saving / playback · Cancel saving"
msgstr "Pause saving / playback · Cancel saving"

msgid "**Esc** 暂停正在播放的视频或图像，也暂停正在进行的批量保存；两者同时进行时会一起暂停。点播放或保存可分别继续。要结束本次保存，选择 **Edit → Cancel saving**。"
msgstr "**Esc** pauses playback and an active batch save, including both when running together. Resume each with Play or Save. To end the save operation, choose **Edit → Cancel saving**."

msgid "Up / Down / Left / Right"
msgstr "Up / Down / Left / Right"

msgid "**方向键**平移超出窗口的画布；在选框模式中移动选中的框。编辑参数时方向键交给文本框，点回图像区即可恢复画布操作。"
msgstr "**Arrow keys** pan a canvas larger than the window, or move the selected box in individual-box mode. While editing, arrow keys navigate text. Click the image area to restore canvas navigation."

msgid "Delete box"
msgstr "Delete box"

msgid "**Delete** 在 **Select individual box** 模式删除选中的框；关闭该模式时会清除全部框。"
msgstr "**Delete** removes the selected box in **Select individual box** mode. With that mode off it clears all boxes."

msgid "Index table / About"
msgstr "Index table / About"

msgid "**F2** 打开索引表；**F1** 打开关于窗口。"
msgstr "**F2** opens the index table; **F1** opens About."

msgid "表中列出默认配置。加载过自定义快捷键后，以当前菜单项旁显示的按键为准。"
msgstr "These are the defaults. If you load a custom shortcut configuration, use the bindings displayed beside the current menu items."

msgid "右键菜单与底部反馈"
msgstr "Context menu and status feedback"

msgid "右键目标图可直接刷新、翻页、保存，或用 **Select image** 按点击位置挑图。放大镜开启后可追加同尺寸框；已有框时可清空，选中单框后可移动或删除该框。填写 **Rename** 旁的文字后，右键菜单还会出现 **Inject title**，仅作用于点中的图。挑图范围和输出示例见{ref}`挑图和导出 <select-export>`。"
msgstr "Right-click a target to refresh, turn pages, save, or use **Select image** to pick by position. With the magnifier active you can add a matching box. Existing boxes can be cleared, and a selected box can be moved or deleted. Enter text beside **Rename** to make **Inject title** available for the clicked image. See {ref}`Select and export <select-export>` for selection scope and output examples."

msgid "单击画面后，从左到右读状态栏：第一栏是当前模式和运行状态；第二栏是页码、来源内的位置及已选框；第三栏是输入模式、来源路径和视频时间；第四栏是输出目录或保存进度。路径被截断时将鼠标悬停在对应栏；要复制路径，按 **F2**。"
msgstr "After clicking an image, read the status bar from left to right: mode and activity; page, position and selected box; input mode, source path and video time; output folder or save progress. Hover over a truncated field for the full text. Press **F2** to access path copying."
